# SLH-M-0002 — Project memories come first

Decided by the user on 2026-11-23.

This folder, `doc/memories/`, is the primary memory of the project. It is
where the user keeps things first. Whatever private memory an agent's tool
keeps outside the repository is secondary to it.

## How to act on it

- Read this folder before relying on a private memory.
- When the user states something meant to hold, write it here. A private
  memory may keep a short pointer to it and nothing more.
- Where a private memory and this folder disagree, this folder is right.
  Correct or delete the private entry.
- Keep in a private memory only what cannot live in the repository.
